    "html": "<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> are two points on a disk of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Z\"></span> rotating at a constant angular speed.</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{Z}{2}\"></span> from the centre and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> is at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Z\"></span> from the centre.</p>\n<p>What <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{linear velocity of X}}{\\textit{linear velocity of Y}}\"></span> and what is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{acceleration of X}}{\\textit{acceleration of Y}}\"></span>?<br/><br/></p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>[1]</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">Option A is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"B\">Option B is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"C\">Option C is shown in the figure above.</li><li data-label=\"D\">Option D is shown in the figure above.</li></ol>"
